<title>USA: Universal TV president to step down.</title>
<headline>Universal TV president to step down.</headline>
<dateline>UNIVERSAL CITY, Calif. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Television said Thursday its president, Tom Thayer, will leave his post to become a producer for the company, effective August 1.</p>
<p>The company did not name a successor to Thayer.</p>
<p>Universal Television, a division of Universal Studios Inc, is owned by Seagram Co Ltd.</p>
